各客户端的接入细节见 `docs/`：[`deepseek-harness.md`](docs/deepseek-harness.md)、[`host-adapter-cursor-doubao.md`](docs/host-adapter-cursor-doubao.md)、[`host-adapter-workbuddy.md`](docs/host-adapter-workbuddy.md)。

